  arcs:
  - title: The Raider War
    description: 'Four sectors, twelve missions: break the raiders'' hold on the Kepler Belt and hunt their Dreadnought into the Void Core.'
    mode: 0
    starsRequired: 0
  - title: Shadow Strike
    description: 'Nine missions over three worlds: take the war down to the Shadow''s planets and end it at the Shadow Station.'
    mode: 1
    starsRequired: 0
  - title: Nova Frontier
    description: Beyond the Void Core a dying star is about to go nova. Escort the colony convoys out through its flares and storms, and break the warlord who hunts them.
    mode: 0
    starsRequired: 0
  - title: The Last Gate
    description: In a rift strewn with the wrecks of a forgotten war, an ancient gate is waking. Fight through the graveyard and what comes through it, and close the gate for good.
    mode: 0
    starsRequired: 0
  - title: Iron Tide
    description: 'Nine missions over an ice world and an ocean of islands: the Kranemark Consortium sends its war fleet, the Iron Tide, to take the free worlds for itself. Turn the tide.'
    mode: 1
    starsRequired: 0
  - title: Hive Fall
    description: 'Nine missions into the Hive: burn its brood on its living world, cross the crystal wastes where it grows its weapons, take back the orbital Halo and kill the Hive Mother.'
    mode: 1
    starsRequired: 0
  endlessAfter: 3
